// Keep this list short, and give each entry a reason.
missingIncludeSystem
// Library entry points are called by the application, not by this repo.
unusedFunction
// Same reason. Newer cppcheck (2.17 does, 2.13 does not) asks for static
// linkage on public functions, because it scans src/ and never sees the
// header and test callers.
staticFunction
// cppcheck 2.x emits an informational nag about premium checkers.
checkersReport
// The list has to work across cppcheck versions, and an ID one version does
// not know (staticFunction, on 2.13) is otherwise reported as unmatched.
unmatchedSuppression
